      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新马级不该勉强追求成绩。\n目前不适合以特定比赛为目标，\n而该优先重视打造身体与磨练技术。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2d80d0f9d11b8f65219fb9d006a84afbb91e2ddb236047b3d5e347397ca575b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
