    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22f6544fe1e829f5e5949936",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时让她在中央培养一定程度的实战经验，\n做好准备，以便在即将到来的经典级\n挑战更高等的比赛……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee0bbea62cce6289d821f9bf7f4eba83e07e7f0e8d59cb0e868d62309ac489e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
